    "io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/publisher-provided": {
      "license": "MIT",
      "notes": "Two deploy modes: run locally via `npx -y digestseo-mcp` (SQLite at ~/.digestseo, bring your own engine API keys), or self-host the Cloudflare Worker (D1 + cron auto-refresh; see SETUP.md or llms-install.md) and connect to your Worker URL at /mcp. Engines are opt-in: each of the five engines activates only when its API key is set.",
